      "excerpts": [
        {
          "line": 16,
          "text": "[`MetaMorpho`](./src/MetaMorpho.sol) vaults are [ERC-4626](https://eips.ethereum.org/EIPS/eip-4626) vaults, with ([ERC-2612](https://eips.ethereum.org/EIPS/eip-2612)) permit."
        },
        {
          "line": 17,
          "text": "One MetaMorpho vault is related to one loan asset on Morpho Blue."
        },
        {
          "line": 18,
          "text": "The [`MetaMorphoFactory`](./src/MetaMorphoFactory.sol) is deploying immutable onchain instances of MetaMorpho vaults."
        },
        {
          "line": 19,
          "text": ""
        },
        {
          "line": 20,
          "text": "Users can supply or withdraw assets at any time, depending on the available liquidity on Morpho Blue."
        },
        {
          "line": 21,
          "text": "A maximum of 30 markets can be enabled on a given MetaMorpho vault."
        },
        {
          "line": 22,
          "text": "Each market has a supply cap that guarantees that allocators cannot reallocate more than that limit to that market."
        },
        {
          "line": 23,
          "text": "The vault can have more exposure to a given market than its supply cap because of donations or because of interests."
        },
        {
          "line": 24,
          "text": "By default, the supply cap of a market is set to 0."
        },
        {
          "line": 25,
          "text": ""
        },
        {
          "line": 26,
          "text": "There are 4 different roles for a MetaMorpho vault: owner, curator, guardian & allocator."
        },
        {
          "line": 27,
          "text": ""
        },
        {
          "line": 28,
          "text": "The vault owner can set a performance fee, cutting up to 50% of the generated interest."
        },
        {
          "line": 83,
          "text": "- Set the `supplyQueue` and `withdrawQueue`, i.e. decide on the order of the markets to supply/withdraw from."
        },
        {
          "line": 84,
          "text": "  - Upon a deposit, the vault will supply up to the cap of each Morpho Blue market in the `supplyQueue` in the order set."
        },
        {
          "line": 85,
          "text": "  - Upon a withdrawal, the vault will withdraw up to the liquidity of each Morpho Blue market in the `withdrawQueue` in the order set."
        },
        {
          "line": 86,
          "text": "  - The `supplyQueue` only contains markets which cap has previously been non-zero."
        },
        {
          "line": 87,
          "text": "  - The `withdrawQueue` contains all markets that have a non-zero cap or a non-zero vault allocation."
        },
        {
          "line": 88,
          "text": "- Instantaneously reallocate funds by supplying on markets of the `withdrawQueue` and withdrawing from markets that have the same loan asset as the vault's asset."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
